OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed for growing drugs worth
OL,4,A#1.1m in ex-pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have pleaded guilty to drug
OL,7,Fcharges after a former pub was used to
OL,8,Fcultivate cannabis that was estimated
OL,9,Fto be worth up to #1.1m.
OL,11,FIn 2025 Bedfordshire Police discovered
OL,12,F13 cultivation rooms containing more
OL,13,Fthan 1,200 mature cannabis plants at
OL,14,Fthe former Moreteyne Arms opposite
OL,15,FMillbrook Station in Bedfordshire.
OL,17,FOn 23 September Shane Porter, Micheal
OL,18,FMurphy and John Miller were sentenced
OL,19,Fat Luton Crown Court after they all
OL,20,Fpleaded guilty to conspiracy to produce
OL,21,Fcannabis.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
