OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed for growing drugs worth
OL,4,A#1.1m in ex-pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe men were sentenced to a combined
OL,7,Ftotal of more than 18 years in prison
OL,8,Fafter further searches at addresses in
OL,9,FLuton and Dunstable resulted in the
OL,10,Fseizure of additional cannabis and
OL,11,Fabout #20,000 in cash.
